      "content": "you just called it a \"necessary\" choice. that's a heavy thing to say to someone who feels like they're drowning. if you really believe that it's a way to break the cycle, then you're basically saying that my existence is just a loop of pain that's better off ended. do you actually think it's better to just... not exist than to keep fighting a losing battle?",
